          "sourceMeaning": "Seere under Amaymon in the chief70 passage; do not transfer this direction across different witnesses.",
          "evidence": {
            "text": " Seere , Sear , or Seir .—The Seventieth Spirit is Seere, Sear, or Seir. He is a Mighty Prince, and Powerful, under Amaymon , King of the East. He appeareth in the Form of a Beautiful Man, riding upon a Winged Horse. His Office is to go and come; and to bring ab",
